  "title": "Indian Dahl with Spinach",
  "description": "Cook plain lentils with Indian spices such as turmeric and garam masala and you get this delicious, authentic dahl. This recipe uses spinach and coconut milk, which is optional. Perfect addition to rice and curry.",
  "authors": [
    "Gill"
